L2Hub licensing
===============

L2Hub is distributed under two licenses, depending on the directory.

1. patches/ and phantoms/ — GNU General Public License v3.0
   Full text: LICENSES/GPL-3.0.txt

   These directories hold changes to the source code of L2J Mobius and code
   that is compiled together with it. Part of L2J Mobius is licensed under
   GPL-3.0, so this code is GPL-3.0 too, and stays GPL-3.0 in any copy.

2. Everything else (launcher/, tools/, scripts/, profiles/, docs/ and the other
   files of this repository) — PolyForm Noncommercial License 1.0.0
   Full text: LICENSES/PolyForm-Noncommercial-1.0.0.md

   You may use, change and share this part for any noncommercial purpose:
   playing alone or with friends, hobby projects, study, testing. Copies and
   changed versions must keep the notice below, with the link to the original
   project. Commercial use is not permitted.

   For clarity, the licensor considers these uses commercial: running a server
   for other people that takes money in any form (donations, paid items,
   services, accounts, access, priority or advertising), selling or renting the
   software or a modified version of it, and offering it as part of a paid
   product or service.

Required Notice: Copyright (c) 2026 Kraffty and the L2Hub contributors (https://github.com/kraffty4/L2Hub)

